# Keep the Docker build context small and reproducible: every image builds with `context: .`
# (image.yml), so BuildKit reads only this root .dockerignore - it governs all five builds
# (Python included; the service-dir .dockerignore is not consulted for a root context). Exclude
# build output, dependencies, and VCS/local cruft that the image rebuilds from source anyway.
.git
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/target
**/coverage
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/*.log
.venv
__pycache__
**/__pycache__
